Reason: plain curl metadata requests returned HTTP403 while the existing samloader client succeeded with its Kies2.0_FUS User-Agent.
Affected: scripts/utils/firmware_utils.sh GET_LATEST_FIRMWARE.
Verify: same Samsung S22 URL fails without UA and succeeds with UA; GET_LATEST_FIRMWARE returns S901BXXSOGZH3/S901BOXMOGZH3/S901BXXSOGZH3.
Rollback: reverse this patch in the fork; download/extract failure must not be marked successful.

diff --git a/scripts/utils/firmware_utils.sh b/scripts/utils/firmware_utils.sh
index 60202ae..2ab708b 100644
